{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15462","headline":"卧病闻吉中孚拜官寄元秘书昆季 · 李端","name":"卧病闻吉中孚拜官寄元秘书昆季","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉家采使不求声，自慰文章道欲行。\n毛遂登门虽异赏，韩非入传滥齐名。\n云归暂爱青山出，客去还愁白发生。\n年少奉亲皆愿达，敢将心事向玄成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15462.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15462","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}